> Gail Reid: When[ Rhod]a Janzen is injured in a car accident shortly after her[ husband] of 15 years dumps her for a man, she[ postp]ones her sabb[atical] and returns to the comfort of her parents' California home. Her parents are leaders of the Menn[onite] church so the[ worldly Rhod]a's return to her Menn[onite] roots is a distinctly different kind of[ memoir].
